375	Blitzcrank	Milio	support	emerald	late	Blitzcrank’s shield and Overdrive make him a durable presence, while Milio’s lack of crowd control utility and low utility spell power makes him easy to close gaps. Blitzcrank should use Static Field early and Rocket Grab to secure kills. If Milio casts Breath of Life, he may be retreating—Blitzcrank should pursue. If Milio is still active in the bottom half, use Power Fist to engage and finish him.	357	16.15.1	0	eager	2026-08-18 13:57:12.305107-04
