492	Alistar	Rell	support	emerald	late	Alistar’s Unbreakable Will can turn the tide by shielding him from all crowd controls, but Rell’s Magnet Storm can still pull him into a position where he is vulnerable. Use Full Tilt to close gaps and support your ally, while using Shattering Strike to disrupt Alistar’s movement. If Alistar remains in the middle, use Pulverize to force him out—his lack of crowd control presence makes him easy to isolate.	390	16.15.1	0	eager	2026-08-18 21:32:45.372605-04
