510	Bard	Rell	support	emerald	late	In the late game, Bard’s Tempered Fate can disrupt Rell’s magnet storm and trap her in a stalemate. Rell’s ability to pull and slow with Magnet Storm and Shattering Strike can be dangerous if she can get a clean stun or crowd control. Bard should use his cosmic binding to slow and trap Rell’s escape routes, while Rell should use her spells to close gaps and pressure the lane. If Rell can secure a takedown, it will shift the momentum. Otherwise, use vision and positioning to survive.	408	16.15.1	0	eager	2026-08-18 22:02:13.422553-04
