519	Bard	Velkoz	support	emerald	late	In the late game, Bard’s mobility and utility allow him to reposition and survive skirmishes. Vel’Koz’s Life Form Disintegration Ray can deal consistent damage if he can get a clean cast, but Bard’s Tempered Fate can disrupt and stall him. Bard can use his spells to close gaps and secure kills, while Vel’Koz must be cautious not to allow Bard to use his crowd control to isolate and engage. If Vel’Koz manages to isolate a champion, he can use Void Rift to finish them off, but Bard’s ability to slow and reposition makes this risky. Prioritize using Cosmic Binding to slow and engage, and Tempered Fate to disrupt and stall.	417	16.15.1	0	eager	2026-08-18 22:14:38.996495-04
